{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Depot. Only open at night, we cater to a variety of unusual clientele under unusual circumstances. It's best not to think too hard though, just deliver those packages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dubious Depot is a job simulation survival horror game. You must deliver packages to waiting clients at their preferred pickup location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be required to complete additional tasks if another employee is no longer able to handle them. It's important to wear many hats as they say.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Potential tasks include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair and maintenance work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assisting Co-workers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing Inventory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have time for it, self care.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do your job, keep the depot running, handle any hazards that may show up along the way, and be polite to your coworkers. We hope to see you next week.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4067430?t=1760136394","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4067430?t=1760136394","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067430/4b961e942849cdac1d7bec1e399bdeb28db7037a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760136394","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067430/4b961e942849cdac1d7bec1e399bdeb28db7037a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760136394","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Depot. Only open at night, we cater to a variety of unusual clientele under unusual circumstances. It's best not to think too hard though, just deliver those packages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dubious Depot is a job simulation survival horror game. You must deliver packages to waiting clients at their preferred pickup location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be required to complete additional tasks if another employee is no longer able to handle them. It's important to wear many hats as they say.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Potential tasks include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair and maintenance work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assisting Co-workers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing Inventory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have time for it, self care.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do your job, keep the depot running, handle any hazards that may show up along the way, and be polite to your coworkers. We hope to see you next week.</p>","developers":["FractureGamesLLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067430/b50d4b16cc96b5675266c1dff9d993f8e6b035d3/header.jpg?t=1760136394","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu, Fedora, or Arch<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel i5 - 1.3hgz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 500 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 120 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> N/A<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> 